{"version":1,"content":"<p>《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》Switch 2重製版取消了原版的自動跳躍，改為由玩家主動按鍵起跳。這項基礎操作的變化讓不少老玩家一時難以適應，林克落水、撞上巖石及跌下平台的片段也隨之在社區傳播。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585770.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.080879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:13:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"c7a0c138c5b76290e955636a15349c8b8c0087cd8cacd04a937e04151e42fe3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}